            <ArticleTitle>[Management of acute severe hyponatremia in a patient undergoing emergency laparotomy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute severe hyponatremia is a medical emergency. The case of a patient presenting this syndrome together with an abdominal surgical emergency is reported. The perioperative management of this severe electrolytic disorder is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
